<title>ESTONIA: ESTONIA-NOON RADIO HEADLINES-JULY 29.</title>
<headline>ESTONIA-NOON RADIO HEADLINES-JULY 29.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>These were the headlines on Kuku Raadio at noon. Reuters has not verified these reports and does not vouch for their accuracy:</p>
<p>- The finance ministry is to call a tender to provide student loans.</p>
<p>- Unexploded bombs were destroyed on Suve peninsula.</p>
<p>-- Tallinn newsroom, +372 620 9201, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
</text>
